      "username": "fjur",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2026-05-19T17:48:06.321Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Heck yeah!!!</p>\n<p>Judging by that cover alone, I’m guessing this issue is about Wraith and Legs swapping cities for whatever reason.</p>\n<p>It is fitting, I think, that the first episode for this new era is about Legacy and The Wraith, as the very first two episodes of the podcast were also, of course, about these two.</p>\n<p>Hm, I wonder if this is the first issue of <em>Justice</em> after the title came back from being on hiatus due to the legal action from rival publisher Justice Comics. That would be a fitting mirror to the recent Metametaverse events.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-05-19T17:48:06.321Z",
