      "raw": "Heck yeah!!!\n\nJudging by that cover alone, I’m guessing this issue is about Wraith and Legs swapping cities for whatever reason.\n\nIt is fitting, I think, that the first episode for this new era is about Legacy and The Wraith, as the very first two episodes of the podcast were also, of course, about these two.\n\nHm, I wonder if this is the first issue of *Justice* after the title came back from being on hiatus due to the legal action from rival publisher Justice Comics. That would be a fitting mirror to the recent Metametaverse events.",
