      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Agreed @fjur that this is a strong team-up for a comeback episode! \n\nThe Legacy fan club letter made me so happy though and I would love to hear more Legacy solo stories, especially those they talked about which have him struggle and face his weaknesses more.  \n\nAlso I seemed to remember the Iron Curtain power source question being asked before, and it was [here](https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php/Podcasts/Episode_I-76). Mostly matches the new answer though. \n\nA sidenote about the new plans though.\nI do hope that whatever they do next instead of Vengeance Returned will be worth adding more waiting time to what they had planned originally. \nIf it's a rearrangement of scheduled products, fine I guess (although putting the space box before Vengeance makes no sense chronologically) but adding more, previously unplanned stuff before Returning to Vengeance would be worrying for the continuation of DE (looking at you, annual RPG one-shots and Revised Starter Kit...).",
