    {
      "id": 265494,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2026-05-19T19:33:51.277Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can you believe, I couldn’t even remember what time episodes usually drop. XD I’ve been catching up with 2025’s episodes, I have three left as of today.</p>\n<p><em>What is this intro music??</em></p>\n<p>I sympathize with Adam, I have also been sitting here the whole time.</p>\n<p>Okay, better music. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I like that little bit of the intro we tend not to get.</p>\n<p>The Disparation rulebook was lying to us? Impossible! Clearly, we got the rulebook from a different universe, it’s true there. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> (Also now a collector’s item!)</p>\n<p>So glad Trevor is back, too, I knew that from the recent Play Greater Podcast episode. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Gasp! Crossword issue??? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Also oh shoot, is this America’s Cleverst Legacy happening?</p>\n<p>I like what injury is doing to Legacy here, that’s not something he’s used to, clearly.</p>\n<p>Honestly, I am really enjoying actually getting to see how Crossword works, I’ve kind of never figured that out.</p>\n<p>Dang, my boy can steal a whole trainload of stuff! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Go, little guy, you’re about to get your butt kicked!</p>\n<p>The Wraith, just rifling through Iron Curtain’s Communist underwear!</p>\n<p>Oh man, hearing the letter song for real feels amazing.</p>\n<p>…Oh my god, that’s a lot of letters.</p>\n<p>Congrats to Striped Burrower for cracking the proverbial champagne bottle over this episode!</p>\n<p>Anarchy Past Midnight? XD Is this a reference? Because that name is great.</p>\n<p>Imagine making Adam read a letter entirely in a bad Australian accent after he hasn’t read anything in a year. XD</p>\n<p><em>Three</em> letters? Oh my! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Wonder what I wrote about.</p>\n<p>I’m glad this was all a bit. XD</p>\n<p>So Crisis Man’s deal is ADHD, got it.</p>\n<p>I think I would ship Tyler and Mason. &lt;_&lt; I might have issues. Of comics!</p>\n<p>We’re back, baby! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> It feels so good! And I don’t think they had to change the outro at all?? Awesome.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-05-19T19:33:51.277Z",
