      "created_at": "2026-05-19T22:43:11.797Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So delightful to have this podcast back, it’s like seeing an old friend after a year.</p>\n<p>Not a lot to say about the main episode, it’s great, but I will say: it’s entirely possible that there is a direct 1 to 1 correlation between Tyler Vance’s travel suit not having heavy weapons built into it and Tyler legally registering said suit to travel as a tourist. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
